review_comments.body:
Ok thanks I got it, I did some testing and it doesn't work with the current wrapper(s). It could be related to a subprocess being created, I finally got it working this way:

```nix
postal-web = serviceDefaults // {
  path = with pkgs; [
    coreutils
    nodejs
  ];

  serviceConfig = serviceConfigDefaults // {
    Type = "notify";
    ExecStart = "${pkgs.postal.rubyEnv}/bin/bundle exec puma -C ${pkgs.postal}/share/postal/config/puma.rb";
    WorkingDirectory = "${pkgs.postal}/share/postal";
  };
};
```

I will try to find a cleaner/less redundant solution :)

